  DTS:Description="Refresh the LOYALTY_TIER domain of ref.CodeCrosswalk, which maps the OLTP tier names onto the conformed TIER1-TIER4 set, and publish the tiers into Dimension.Loyalty Tier with the regional discount schedule: richer in APAC, capped at five percent in the EU by local promotion rules and the legacy schedule in NA."
